Hello! I heard of your great deeds on the Shadow Road.
Much happened while you were there. Many warriors died on the high seas while searching for clues of Midranda. The leader of the Royal Archers, Arteres, was captured and tortured, barely escaping.
This is the Magic Breather. I built it with the Magic Stones I made with the Elemental Priestesses. With it, Pristonians can walk and breathe at the bottom of the sea.

We need you. Marina is our contact in the Abyss of the Sea. But stay calm; the mermaid can be rude to strangers.

[Challenge Objective]

Talk to Marina in the Abyss of the Sea.
